OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785692892
OL,3,CTruck explodes outside Colombia police
OL,4,Cbase, injuring 11 officers
OL,6,FColombia's government on Saturday
OL,7,Fblamed the nation's largest remaining
OL,8,Frebel group for an explosion outside a
OL,9,Fpolice base that injured 11 officers
OL,10,Fand killed a police dog.
OL,12,FThe attack took place early Saturday
OL,13,Fin Cucuta, a city along Colombia's
OL,14,Fborder with Venezuela, where drug
OL,15,Fgangs and rebel groups have long
OL,16,Ffought for control of smuggling routes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
