PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785692892
OL,3,CTruck explodes outside Colombia police
OL,4,Cbase, injuring 11 officers
OL,6,FGen. William Rincon, the director of
OL,7,FColombia's police, said the blast came
OL,8,Ffrom a truck that had been left
OL,9,Foutside a building that serves as the
OL,10,Fheadquarters for police in Norte de
OL,11,FSantander Province. The pre-dawn
OL,12,Fexplosion damaged much of the
OL,13,Fbuilding's roofing and shattered its
OL,14,Fwindows.
OL,16,F"This was a vile terrorist attack,"
OL,17,FRincon said. "We will not rest until
OL,18,Fwe find those who are responsible and
OL,19,Fhave them prosecuted."
OL,26,@xD@AOUxD@cO]yD@NOU{D@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
