OL,3,CTruck explodes outside Colombia police
OL,4,Cbase, injuring 11 officers
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FIn a message on X, Colombian Defence
OL,12,FMinister Pedro Sanchez blamed the
OL,13,FNational Liberation Army rebel group
OL,14,Ffor the attack, and offered a $60,000
OL,15,Freward for information leading to
OL,16,Fthose behind the car bombing.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
