PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785692892
OL,3,CTruck explodes outside Colombia police
OL,4,Cbase, injuring 11 officers
OL,6,FThe attack comes as Colombia prepares
OL,7,Fto inaugurate a new president. Next
OL,8,FFriday, Abelardo de la Espriella, an
OL,9,Fultra-conservative who has promised to
OL,10,Fcancel peace talks with the nation's
OL,11,Fremaining rebel groups, will be sworn
OL,12,Finto office in Cali, another Colombian
OL,13,Fcity where rebel groups have staged
OL,14,Fattacks recently.
OL,16,FThe National Liberation Army, or ELN,
OL,17,Fhas been fighting Colombia's
OL,18,Fgovernment for decades, and is
OL,19,Fbelieved to have 6,000 fighters
OL,20,Foperating in Colombia and neighbouring
OL,21,FVenezuela.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
