PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785692892
OL,3,CTruck explodes outside Colombia police
OL,4,Cbase, injuring 11 officers
OL,6,FThe group was founded in the 1960s by
OL,7,Funion leaders, students and peasants
OL,8,Fseeking social justice, but has
OL,9,Flargely transformed into a criminal
OL,10,Forganisation that profits from illegal
OL,11,Fgold mining and drug trafficking,
OL,12,Faccording to Colombian authorities,
OL,13,Fwith President Gustavo Petro often
OL,14,Faccusing its leaders of acting as
OL,15,F"drug lords dressed up as guerrilla
OL,16,Ffighters."
OL,26,@wD@AOUxD@JO]
