PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785692892
OL,3,CTruck explodes outside Colombia police
OL,4,Cbase, injuring 11 officers
OL,6,FUnder outgoing President Gustavo
OL,7,FPetro, who was elected in 2022,
OL,8,FColombia staged peace negotiations
OL,9,Fwith the ELN. But the talks fell apart
OL,10,Fearly last year, after the ELN staged
OL,11,Fattacks in the rural area north of
OL,12,FCucuta, in which an estimated 78
OL,13,Fpeople were killed. At least 56,000
OL,14,Fhad to flee their homes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
