PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785692892
OL,3,CTruck explodes outside Colombia police
OL,4,Cbase, injuring 11 officers
OL,6,FIncoming President Abelardo de la
OL,7,FEspriella has said he will confront
OL,8,Fthe ELN and criminal groups in
OL,9,FColombia with greater military force,
OL,10,Fand will resume the aerial fumigation
OL,11,Fof coca crops, the raw material for
OL,12,Fcocaine.
OL,14,FPetro attempted to launch peace talks
OL,15,Fwith several armed groups during his
OL,16,Ftenure under a strategy known as Total
OL,17,FPeace. But critics say many of these
OL,18,Fgroups used ceasefires granted to them
OL,19,Fby the government to regroup, rearm
OL,20,Fand strengthen their grip over rural
OL,21,Fcommunities.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
