PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785692892
OL,3,CTruck explodes outside Colombia police
OL,4,Cbase, injuring 11 officers
OL,6,FA peace deal between Colombia's
OL,7,Fgovernment and the Revolutionary Armed
OL,8,FForces of Colombia led to the
OL,9,Fdisarmament of more than 13,000
OL,10,Fguerrilla fighters in 2016. That left
OL,11,Fa power vacuum in some rural areas
OL,12,Fthat smaller groups like the ELN have
OL,13,Ftried to fill.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
